82", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499619751_1078851984480415_291454914087735716_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=MlWsOI1a_yQQ7kNvwEeoLgF&_nc_oc=AdrKbxLIh4vDRQBYPVBcrJEaLToR-F0dggIWY4HC2bNKcbVZGKf3TXJw1-i1j_qNagk&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQTxW_MzbprQC_mfWwuHh2PZ2oMIRYjXjnQoKmOeMhUO1Q&oe=6AF9C47B"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "HTVR Splash.PNG", "id": "1665694187853733", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw6-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499619668_1665694191187066_8861710446975398578_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=MUs3mX9c8JwQ7kNvwGqrC9U&_nc_oc=AdptFToxARi2IpQ6VxnQhd9lydoPgEW_VCZi0FjndOdSXkmTKWMk1-FM-OX5gEa-lyY&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw6-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQRoINfae-aSMhbopRG0ryDIZixzh1oFKLv6_cb7-oQ4vg&oe=6AF9CEE4"}, "display_name": "Heroes Together VR", "keywords": ["multiplayer", "social", "team", "fighting", "class"], "long_description": "**GATHER YOUR PARTY**\n\nBring your friends. They'll share potions, watch your back, and, at some point, absolutely leave you to the monsters so they can make it out alive, but hey, you\u2019d do the same for them.\n\n**CHOOSE YOUR HERO**\n\nGo full spellcaster as the Mage, or pick off enemies as the Archer. Prefer close combat? Knight and Brawler have you covered. And if two of you pick the same Hero? That's when things get interesting. Deck yours out in colours, props, and accessories so your party can actually find you in the chaos instead of yelling \u201cwait, which one's you?\u201d\n\n**PASS ON POWER POSES**\n\nPower Poses are basically the world's most useful secret handshake. Strike a pose, get a buff. Teach that pose to your party, and now everyone\u2019s flexing together. In Heroes Together VR, sharing really is caring (and it makes you stronger too).\n\n**FIND THE CRITTERS**\n\nEveryone on the team has a favourite critter and will fight you about it. Meet Dot, Tad, and Kai, then pick a side. They're small. They're cute. They will absolutely distract your party mid-run, and you\u2019ll love them for it.\n\n**UNWIND IN TETHERFALL**\n\nWhile your local Mage spends twenty minutes finding the perfect hat or your friendly Brawler needs to rest their arms, hit the beach for Uppyball, grab a (virtual) snack at Hero's Nook, or just vibe by the Lagoon.\n\n**BUILD TO PLAY AGAIN**\n\nNo two runs through Gobi Gulch play out the same, which means no two runs go wrong the same way either. Play it safe or choose the chaos route for the drama. You\u2019ll still be a Hero to us!", "short_description": "Heroes Together VR is a 4-player co-op roguelite dungeon crawler. Pick your Hero, fight your way through Gobi Gulch, and figure out how to work as a team, because no run goes the same way twice."}]}, "developer_name": "Basement Bunker Labs", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://heroestogethervr.com/privacy-policy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Basement Bunker Labs", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://heroestogethervr.com/", "category": "GAMES", "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "2691890164460465"}, {"id": "459781504968480"}, {"id": "1023770785722696"}, {"id": "2710427532541308"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": ["ACTION"], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en", "fr_CA", "de", "es", "it", "pt_BR"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["SITTING", "STANDING"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["MULTI_USER", "SINGLE_USER"], "id": "39424014320576001"}, "review_messages": []}]}, "cover_square_image": {"uri": "https://sc